                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.AI.Speech.Transcription_1.0.0"&gt;Azure.AI.Speech.Transcription_1.0.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.0.0 (2026-05-14)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First stable release of the Azure.AI.Speech.Transcription client library.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removed &lt;code&gt;TranscriptionResult.PhrasesByChannel&lt;/code&gt; and the associated &lt;code&gt;TranscribedPhrases&lt;/code&gt; type. Use &lt;code&gt;TranscriptionResult.Phrases&lt;/code&gt; for the flat phrase list and &lt;code&gt;TranscriptionResult.CombinedPhrases&lt;/code&gt; for the per-channel combined transcript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
