&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Continuous Profiler] Add experimental support for Linux ARM64&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Fix body analysis on downstream requests causing stream-closed issues&lt;/li&gt;
