&lt;li&gt;Skip sending errors to instrumentation telemetry for performance counter initialization (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4420274038" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8598" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8598/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8598"&gt;#8598&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add handling of &lt;code&gt;OutOfMemoryException&lt;/code&gt; to runtime metrics polyfill (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4428440925" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8609" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8609/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8609"&gt;#8609&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
